IRIDESCENT SPHERE GRID
Form: 9 identical spheres in 3x3 matrix
Ground: solid black
Light: internal refraction + rim highlights + thin-film interference

Row 1
L: cyan-yellow-red band + green base
C: blue-violet-pink band + yellow base
R: magenta-orange-cyan fade

Row 2
L: yellow-blue-red band + orange base
C: pale lavender-white + dark violet base
R: green-magenta-cyan band

Row 3
L: lime-yellow-magenta band + cyan base
C: mint-teal fade + grey-green base
R: orange-blue-gold band

Variables
- Hue rotation per cell
- Highlight height (upper third)
- Saturation peak at equator
- Edge chromatic fringe

Fundamentals
- High value contrast against black
- Complementary color pairing
- Radial symmetry inside each sphere
- Grid alignment for repetition + variation
